{"4911970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demon God Story", "steam_appid": 4911970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the distant ancient era, a legendary mage obtained knowledge of the creation laws from another world and mastered powerful magic capable of destroying heaven and earth. In order to open up his own new world, he ruthlessly destroyed countless nations. The dragon race and giant race joined forces to fight him for thousands of years, ultimately sealing him in the dark demon domain. The giants and dragons guarded the barrier with their flesh and blood, strengthening the seal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, as long years passed, the guardians gradually corrupted, leaving only piles of dry bones. The sealing barrier weakened accordingly. The mage's remnant soul and evil thoughts attached to the bones, transforming into the terrifying Skeleton Demon God, constantly releasing corrupting particles to further weaken the barrier...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To save the continent on the verge of destruction, the protagonist is summoned by a mysterious power and embarks on an epic journey to the Skeleton Demon Domain to eliminate the Skeleton Demon God.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Visual Feast: Excellent lighting and pixel art perfectly combined to create an ultimate atmosphere and deep immersion. Every frame is as exquisite as an oil painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/d2f4a392ecb709bbed78192be071b225.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/d2f4a392ecb709bbed78192be071b225.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/d2f4a392ecb709bbed78192be071b225.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Weapon and Magic System: Multiple weapons and magic can be freely combined to unlock a vast array of combat combinations and create your unique fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/b91cb40e2e9b9b02a22e3aec037e08c3.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/b91cb40e2e9b9b02a22e3aec037e08c3.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/b91cb40e2e9b9b02a22e3aec037e08c3.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Epic Soundtrack: Multiple custom shocking songs that enhance the story's appeal and world immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/5d00cc3a20f1812d033c0dd20976470e.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/5d00cc3a20f1812d033c0dd20976470e.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/5d00cc3a20f1812d033c0dd20976470e.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Level Design: Rich and differentiated levels with intricate mechanisms, full of challenge and fun. Every exploration brings fresh surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/60db35bc3a30d8589dc41d5826552c26.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/60db35bc3a30d8589dc41d5826552c26.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/60db35bc3a30d8589dc41d5826552c26.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite Narrative Presentation: High-quality cutscenes and profound storytelling immerse you in this thousand-year legend of the Demon God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/8b5594e83b6862bc3d49d3e57169a9ac.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/8b5594e83b6862bc3d49d3e57169a9ac.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/8b5594e83b6862bc3d49d3e57169a9ac.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the distant ancient era, a legendary mage obtained knowledge of the creation laws from another world and mastered powerful magic capable of destroying heaven and earth. In order to open up his own new world, he ruthlessly destroyed countless nations. The dragon race and giant race joined forces to fight him for thousands of years, ultimately sealing him in the dark demon domain. The giants and dragons guarded the barrier with their flesh and blood, strengthening the seal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/a9afbf67ed6e1f102503576676c485b1.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, as long years passed, the guardians gradually corrupted, leaving only piles of dry bones. The sealing barrier weakened accordingly. The mage's remnant soul and evil thoughts attached to the bones, transforming into the terrifying Skeleton Demon God, constantly releasing corrupting particles to further weaken the barrier...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.webm?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/6e8ce71466a6ab96fd23f96375bf7f86.mp4?t=1785938876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To save the continent on the verge of destruction, the protagonist is summoned by a mysterious power and embarks on an epic journey to the Skeleton Demon Domain to eliminate the Skeleton Demon God.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Visual Feast: Excellent lighting and pixel art perfectly combined to create an ultimate atmosphere and deep immersion. Every frame is as exquisite as an oil painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4911970/extras/d2f4a392ecb709bbed78192be071b225.poster.avif?t=1785938876\" width=800 heigh